  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanmai construction project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Opium cultivation in Lao PDR takes place in the most remote and marginalized communities of the country. To establish sustainable alternative livelihoods, farmers from these communities must establish structures for value-adding and increasing their control of the value chain. This project aims to build infrastructures that will enable former opium-growing communities in Houaphanh province to process and export high-quality coffee independently by providing access to the necessary infrastructure</narrative>
  </description>
